id: focus-surging-power
# Technological Being's Option, copied for Genetic Focus: Android (4).
name: Surging Power
order: 1
optionOf: genetic-focus-android
optionEffect: 4
description: >
  Spend 3(bT) Ki Points to gain an additional stack of Power.
text: >
  Surging Power [Triggered/Power]: Spend 3(bT) Ki Points to gain an additional stack of Power.

---

# The Power Up's window, its Triggered/Automatic button all the same, starting on Triggered - it spends Ki (the user's): 3(bT) Ki, a stack more - Power still at most 2, its own clock as the Power Up's.
[triggered/power, toggle, startsTriggered, effect 4]
requires power.stacks < 2 && ki.value >= 3(bT);
ki.value -= 3(bT);
power.stacks += 1;
expires(power, next-turn);
